Phone dead in Japan? Ask this to find the nearest station 🚉
Left, right, and 'five minutes' are the words you'll hear.

Today's phrases:
• いちばん ちかい (ichiban chikai) = Nearest
• ひだり (hidari) = Left
• あるいて (aruite) = On foot

